/// staleHours`): entries older than this are dropped at boot; `0`
/// disables the belt.
const defaultJobsStaleHours = 24;

/// Default retention for `.fah/bash_jobs/*.log` (`jobs:
/// logRetentionDays`): older logs are deleted at boot; `0` keeps every
